00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:50.067
- Thank you!

00:00:50.067 --> 00:00:52.410
- So how did this all get started?

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:56.270
- So I've always had a really
special place in my heart

00:00:56.270 --> 00:00:57.200
for animals.

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:00.080
And during the pandemic, unfortunately,

00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:03.160
