activities got canceled.

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:04.640
And when I found about,

00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:06.710
found out about,

00:01:06.710 --> 00:01:11.710
why so many disabled animals
get euthanized at shelters,

00:01:11.750 --> 00:01:14.170
I decided I needed to
do something about this.

00:01:14.170 --> 00:01:18.040
So, I watched a lot of YouTube videos,

00:01:18.040 --> 00:01:20.830
and I eventually made my first wheelchair

00:01:20.830 --> 00:01:23.700
and actually made it for a Great Dane

00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:25.330
in Oregon named Cyprus,

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:27.700
and ever since then,

00:01:27.700 --> 00:01:30.530
I've just been making wheelchairs.

00:01:30.530 --> 00:01:35.530
And they can take from a few
weeks to a few months to make.

00:01:36.070 --> 00:01:38.760
- Oh, you have such a great heart Shaine.

00:01:38.760 --> 00:01:40.760
This is the sweetest thing ever.

00:01:40.760 --> 00:01:43.730
You've taken your efforts
international as well, right?

00:01:43.730 --> 00:01:44.563
- Yeah.

00:01:44.563 --> 00:01:49.563
I recently made two wheelchairs
for two different dogs.

00:01:49.630 --> 00:01:53.160
They both came from Saudi Arabia paralyzed

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:55.500
and when I made them their wheelchairs,

00:01:55.500 --> 00:01:58.830
I was actually able to meet them in person

00:01:58.830 --> 00:02:00.470
to give them their wheelchairs.

00:02:00.470 --> 00:02:02.630
And I saw them use them,

00:02:02.630 --> 00:02:04.750
use their wheelchairs for the first time

00:02:04.750 --> 00:02:06.670
and it made me so happy.

00:02:06.670 --> 00:02:09.710
So I was absolutely thrilled.

00:02:09.710 --> 00:02:11.430
Their names are Scooter and Happy,

00:02:11.430 --> 00:02:14.666
and they're now living at
a sanctuary in Wisconsin.

00:02:14.666 --> 00:02:16.043
- (audience clapping) Oh my gosh.

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:21.040
You are such a beautiful
woman inside and out.

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:21.873
Like what a,

00:02:21.873 --> 00:02:23.550
what a beautiful thing you're
doing for these animals.

00:02:23.550 --> 00:02:26.330
That's so, their quality
of life is enhanced.

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:27.270
It's a beautiful thing you're doing.

00:02:27.270 --> 00:02:28.740
Thank you so much, Shaine.

